# Large/local-only files excluded from the app deployment. The API functions
# stay included and provide authenticated live-sheet access.
#
# The user picks or drops production workbooks and Plate Tracker parses them in
# the browser. The live extracts under sheets/ are ~72MB and no endpoint serves
# them; excluding them keeps the deployment upload small and fast.
sheets/

# Verification scripts and their fixtures. They run from a clone, not from the
# deployed site.
scripts/
test/

# Local-only dev server — reads the gitignored service-account.json to serve
# the sheet proxies on localhost. Runs from a clone, never deployed.
local-auth.mjs

# Development and verification scratch.
.playwright-cli/
claude-flow/
CLAUDE.md
.clinerules
*.log
*.txt
!README*.txt

# Screenshots produced by the audits and smoke tests.
plate-tracker-*.png
